    "note": "The three team marks and the three logotypes are wired after a byte comparison against the canonical files on the team branding page; ds:audit re-checks each sha256 AND every mirror of it in the repo, so a silent recolor cannot land in the bundle or in public/. Everything else renders a marked empty slot. RESOLVED: public/assets/logos/Mark-Gold.svg was recolored (#D4AF37 against a canonical #ffe629) and live on the splash, the access gate and the landing page; all three public copies have been replaced with the canonical files and are registered as mirrors. REFUSED: assets/team/5669-Seal.svg was fetched from the canonical source and NOT adopted - the published seal carries #ffe623 in all 71 of its gold declarations, a near-gold rather than the published Techmen Gold #FFE629 that Mark-Gold.svg and Type-Gold.svg both carry. It stays an empty slot and the refusal is recorded under `rejected` in assets/PROVENANCE.json.",
